# One-time tutorial tips. Each tip shows the first time its moment comes up
# (once per game session), in a box over the screen. Click to go through the lines.
# Keep each line under ~110 characters. Every cue must end with => END.

~ tip_night
Every night, this report tells you what happened on the farm.
Click to read on.
=> END

~ tip_door
Visitors come to your door each morning. You can choose to admit or deny them from the farm
They might be infected, so test them if you can (-1 meals)
Remember: individuals who are infected will day 3 days from the moment of infection
=> END

~ tip_command
You can give people jobs on the farm, click on a job to cycle through the list
GUARD keeps strangers out. GARDEN grows food. FORAGE is a 2-night trip for food and materials.
RESEARCH works toward a cure. 
T tests a resident and X exiles them. Each costs 1 meal.
=> END

~ tip_infected
Someone on your farm is infected. They will die within three nights, and the rot will spread when they do.
=> END

~ tip_no_guard
If there's no guard stationed, people might slip in
=> END

~ tip_beds
You have enough materials to build a bed. 
Delegate someone to BUILD BED to make room for one more resident.
=> END

~ tip_lab
To get the chemicals, set one resident's job to LAB. The trip takes 4 nights.
=> END

~ tip_synth
You have the chemicals. Set someone to SYNTH to make the cure.
=> END
